libcore ICU natives on the QNX sysroot ICU 4.6 (q20-android)

The stock file targets ICU 55 with a mapped icudt55l.dat. On QNX the data is
linked statically, a few APIs are newer than 4.6, NumberFormat takes the old
EStyles enum, and the 4.6 data lacks AmPmMarkersNarrow, which made
initLocaleDataNative fail for every locale.

